{"about_the_game":"To play Burnit Quest you must first download the Fit Controller app on your phone!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A Mobile-Enhanced Fitness Platformer for 1 to 2 Players!</i></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/43b09455301170328bb87e654a1fd8c0.poster.avif?t=1680742158\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/43b09455301170328bb87e654a1fd8c0.webm?t=1680742158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/43b09455301170328bb87e654a1fd8c0.mp4?t=1680742158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An immersive fitness experience</h2>In Burnit Quest you will use your controller's movement to transfer actual exercise data. Making up for a fun and engaging fitness experience! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/320c7d458182ff81c8061211a791f92a.poster.avif?t=1680742158\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/320c7d458182ff81c8061211a791f92a.webm?t=1680742158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/320c7d458182ff81c8061211a791f92a.mp4?t=1680742158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Couch co-op  and versus modes</h2>Working out with friends is always better! Grab a friend and get ready to work out in good company in the <strong>co-op campaign</strong>. <br>Or face each other in the various <strong>versus modes</strong>, and find out who is the mightiest!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >40 unique stages</h2>Explore Pok island in 8 different environments that, and face all kinds of challenges that require different types of exercise to beat! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Underwater stages:</strong> Swim by doing jumping jacks..<br></li><li><strong>Platforming stages:</strong> Move by running, attack with punches and squat to perform jumps!<br></li><li><strong>Slingshot stages:</strong> Use sit ups to operate a giant slingshot<br></li><li><strong>Fishing mini game:</strong> Squat to throw the line and lure the fish!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >8 terrifying bosses</h2>Face fierce enemies each with their unique pattern and weakness. <br>Are you fit enough to beat them?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/a7dbf223bef2c56f1122153e9f21e9df.poster.avif?t=1680742158\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/a7dbf223bef2c56f1122153e9f21e9df.webm?t=1680742158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/a7dbf223bef2c56f1122153e9f21e9df.mp4?t=1680742158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills to master</h2>Get in shape in life and in the game. Improve your speed, attack and more by investing in up to 22 different skills!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exercise log</h2>This exergame tracks of your fitness progress, high scores, current and previous session in order to keep you motivated to improve!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Warming Up! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1651280/8e4d7b4f56800bdb3000ac3b28b2d89a24e16abf.jpg"},{"name":"Feel the Burn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1651280/4ce2d096b2c65de80a0945f2702d6823e06852ce.jpg"},{"name":"Flame Acolyte","path":"https: