trong>. <br>Or face each other in the various <strong>versus modes</strong>, and find out who is the mightiest!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >40 unique stages</h2>Explore Pok island in 8 different environments that, and face all kinds of challenges that require different types of exercise to beat! <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Underwater stages:</strong> Swim by doing jumping jacks..<br></li><li><strong>Platforming stages:</strong> Move by running, attack with punches and squat to perform jumps!<br></li><li><strong>Slingshot stages:</strong> Use sit ups to operate a giant slingshot<br></li><li><strong>Fishing mini game:</strong> Squat to throw the line and lure the fish!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >8 terrifying bosses</h2>Face fierce enemies each with their unique pattern and weakness. <br>Are you fit enough to beat them?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/a7dbf223bef2c56f1122153e9f21e9df.poster.avif?t=1680742158\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/a7dbf223bef2c56f1122153e9f21e9df.webm?t=1680742158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/a7dbf223bef2c56f1122153e9f21e9df.mp4?t=1680742158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills to master</h2>Get in shape in life and in the game. Improve your speed, attack and more by investing in up to 22 different skills!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exercise log</h2>This exergame tracks of your fitness progress, high scores, current and previous session in order to keep you motivated to improve!","developers":["Wompa"],"dlc":[2010020],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https: